<p>Channel raw magical energy into your melee attacks; each blow you land will do an additional <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">51, 65, 76, 85, 93</acronym> darkness damage.</p><p>The damage will improve with your Spellpower.</p>